   "job_title": "Supply Chain Analyst Intern at Tech Mahindra",
   "description": "Tech Mahindra is hiring a Supply Chain Analyst Intern in Pune for a 6-month, fully mentored internship. This is real, reviewed work on live projects — not a training sandbox or a certificate mill.\n\nAbout the internship\nYou will join the supply chain analytics team and work alongside people who do this professionally every day. From week one you own a scoped piece of work, take it through review, and see it ship.\n\nDay-to-day responsibilities\n• Analyse inventory, demand and fulfilment data.\n• Build dashboards tracking supply chain KPIs.\n• Identify cost and service-level improvements.\n• Support planning cycles with clean analysis.\n• Document your work clearly so the next person can pick it up.\n• Take part in stand-ups, planning and review sessions with the team.\n\nTools and technologies you will use\nSupply Chain, Advanced Excel, SQL, Data Analysis, Inventory Management, Demand Planning, Power BI, Reporting, Forecasting, Problem Solving — plus the internal tooling Tech Mahindra uses day to day.\n\nWhat you will learn\nHow supply chain decisions are driven by data — forecasting, service levels and the cost of getting it wrong.\n\nTeam structure\nYou report to a senior team member who acts as your mentor, inside a pod of 6-10 people. Weekly 1:1s track progress and a mid-internship review tells you exactly where you stand.\n\nWhat we expect from you\nCuriosity, ownership and clear communication. You are not expected to know every tool listed — you are expected to have solid fundamentals, ask good questions, and document what you do.\n\nDetails: ₹30,000/month stipend · 6 months · Work From Office · 2 openings · Pune.\n\nIf you want to start a career in supply chain analytics in Pune, apply now. Responsibilities: Analyse inventory, demand and fulfilment data.; Build dashboards tracking supply chain KPIs.; Identify cost and service-level improvements.; Support planning cycles with clean analysis.; Document your work so the next person can pick 